+**ReShiki #386 phase 2 — local UI verification: FAIL at Perspective 100%.**
+
+The supplied verification bundle was tested on 2026-10-20 (Asia/Tokyo). At 20% and 50%, the complete selection frame surrounded the model and the floating “Show as” bar sat directly below it. At 100%, only the right vertical frame edge remained visible; the bar moved to the canvas bottom. Rotating at 100% reproduced the same failure. Returning to 20% restored the original frame and bar positions exactly.
+
+**Setup and isolation**
