+- The drawing opened at **175% zoom**, rather than the previous run’s reported 158%. The opening zoom and window size were preserved throughout.
+- Selected the arrow tool, then clicked the model once at screenshot coordinate `(870,736)` px, equivalent to window-relative `(435,368)` pt. Properties already showed the expanded 3D model section and Perspective slider; no inspector scrolling was needed.
+- Before every P01–P06 evidence capture, parked the pointer on the verification window’s blank title-bar area using screenshot coordinate `(1600,30)` px, equivalent to window-relative `(800,15)` pt. Captures used `screencapture -x -o -l 7762 "<filename>"`; all images are window-only, 2560 × 1704 px.
+- The installed app was never focused, clicked, captured, opened, or quit. The drawing was not saved. No repository files or system settings were changed.
+
+```sh
+open -n "/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-shiranui-dev-ReShiki/dd6a248f-7145-4e1e-bc5b-a50dfb88eed0/scratchpad/apps-appfix-2/ReShiki386Fix2Evidence.app" --env RESHIKI_DATA_DIR=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-shiranui-dev-ReShiki/dd6a248f-7145-4e1e-bc5b-a50dfb88eed0/scratchpad/ev386-2-appfix-data --args --open "/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-shiranui-dev-ReShiki/dd6a248f-7145-4e1e-bc5b-a50dfb88eed0/scratchpad/ev386-2-final/input/own/caffeine-ballstick-flat.rsk"
+```
+
+**Measurement method**
+
+Coordinates below are zero-based, inclusive pixels in the original PNG, measured from the window’s top-left, including the title bar. The canvas scan region is `x=208..1959, y=364..1619`. Exact RGB `(62,133,117)` runs at least 300 px long identify frame edges; corner handles and the rotation handle are excluded from these runs. Canvas counts include every exact-color pixel in that region, including selection handles. A separate count includes only the detected long edge runs.
+
+The nominal 2-px strokes can rasterize as one exact-color column plus antialiasing. Accordingly, the reported frame size is the inclusive envelope of the detected exact-color edge cores, excluding handles, not a subpixel geometric measurement. Antialiasing pixels are not counted. Bar bounds use the exact RGB `(214,219,223)` border core, excluding shadow and antialiasing. Gaps and bottom clearance count empty pixel rows.
+
+Two independent decoders agreed on all five principal captures: a standard-library PNG decoder and an AppKit bitmap decoder. The first is [measurement-frames.py](measurement-frames.py), with results in [measurements-pixels.json](measurements-pixels.json). The latter’s reproducible results are in [independent-pixel-check.json](independent-pixel-check.json), generated by [verify-pixels.swift](verify-pixels.swift).
