+| [P04-back-to-20.png](P04-back-to-20.png) | **20%**; `Drawing updated` | Identical to P01: left `529`, right `1463..1464`, top `524..525`, bottom `1458..1459`; **936 × 936 px**. | **7,166 / 6,440** | Identical to P01: `(720,1475)..(1272,1543)`, **15 px gap**, **76 px bottom clearance**. | **PASS** — complete frame restored; **zero differing exact frame-color mask pixels** versus P01. |
