+
+For P01/P04, the horizontal runs occupy `x=537..1456` (920 px each); vertical runs occupy `y=532..1451` (920 px each). For P02, horizontal runs occupy `x=533..1459` (927 px each); vertical runs occupy `y=528..1455` (928 px each). These endpoints stop before the handles. At 100%, the exact-color vertical core has adjacent antialiased columns; “1 × 1,256” describes the exact-color core, not the nominal stroke width.
+
+At 100%, the bar control is fully inside the canvas, but its shadow reaches and is clipped at the canvas bottom. Its bottom placement is the failure; the control is not itself cut off.
+
+**Actions, observations, and expectations**
+
+Every drag used the supplied executable:
