+
+**What could not be verified and why**
+
+The full frame edges and dimensions at 100%, and therefore the requested “under twice the flat frame” bound, cannot be established from these window-only screenshots because three frame edges are outside the visible canvas or otherwise not rendered there. No offscreen size or historical “~6×” growth factor is asserted. The directly observable full-frame and bar-placement requirements fail at 100%, including after rotation.
+
